| LICENSE-APACHE | https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt                  | cfc7749b96f63bd31c3c42b5c471bf756814053e847c10f3eb003417bc523d30 |
| LICENSE-GPL    | https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt (verbatim; retrieved    | 3972dc9744f6499f0f9b2dbf76696f2ae7ad8af9b23dde66d6af86c9dfb36986 |
|                | via the GNU coreutils COPYING file, which is byte-identical)     |                                                                  |
